Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 20:31:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: OnePlus 8 Pro sensor layout
 and OIS start

Take the SMEM sensor layout from the item size, now that every phone runs its own SLPI firmware, and start the main camera OIS only once the camera stays on.

Also restore the checksums of the earlier patches, which the USB-C audio change had replaced with ones that do not match the files.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
---
